  <abstract format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Recommendation ITU-T J.185 describes a transmission method for transferring multi-channel television signals over optical access networks. ITU-T J.185 transmission equipment is capable of realizing multi‑channel AM-VSB, 64-QAM, and 256-QAM video signal transmission through the use of frequency modulation conversion.</abstract>
